      "type": "markdown",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 76,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 6
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Evidence context",
        "content": "Charts showing top values can omit less frequent values; event-ID slices form disjoint categories, including Other events. ATT&CK tags come from named Sysmon rules, can overlap, and do not confirm an attack. Event 23 archival deletion is disabled; event 26 records deletion without archival. Missing DNS, process-access or tags can follow collection rules. Historical activity does not establish current connectivity. Expand evidence rows for complete commands, ancestry and raw Sysmon fields."
      }
    },
